  "bio": "Bisous Bisous Paris, located in the artistic hub of Paris, France, is a vibrant gathering spot for traditional, illustrative, and fine line tattoo enthusiasts. Open from Tuesday to Saturday, our inclusive tattoo studio not only features a diverse range of talented resident artists, but also hosts a myriad of guest artists, providing an eclectic mixture of styles in a welcoming, dynamic environment. Come explore, get inspired, and leave with a French kiss - a unique tattoo etched with Parisian flair."
